WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:06.380
Cora and the lobsters were trapped.

2
00:00:06.381 --> 00:00:09.824
"What do we do now?" Mo asked.

3
00:00:09.825 --> 00:00:13.935
"Mo, you've got to get help!" Cora said.

4
00:00:13.936 --> 00:00:23.398
Mo gulped. "I'll try, Cora."

5
00:00:23.399 --> 00:00:25.599
Mo swam off.

6
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:28.783
He had to get help—all by himself!

7
00:00:28.784 --> 00:00:33.149
"I need someone strong," he thought.

8
00:00:33.150 --> 00:00:36.267
"Someone big who can break that cage."

9
00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:40.880
Mo saw lots of fish and sea creatures.

10
00:00:40.881 --> 00:00:45.992
But none looked very strong.

11
00:00:45.993 --> 00:00:49.667
Suddenly Mo saw a huge shadow.

12
00:00:49.668 --> 00:00:52.132
It was the hammerhead shark!

13
00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:55.201
Mo ducked behind some coral.

14
00:00:55.202 --> 00:01:01.523
"The shark is big and strong," Mo thought.

15
00:01:01.524 --> 00:01:03.979
"Maybe he can help me!

16
00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:06.330
But sharks eat fish like me.

17
00:01:06.331 --> 00:01:08.790
What should I do?"

18
00:01:08.791 --> 00:01:11.840
Mo thought of Cora and the lobsters.

19
00:01:11.841 --> 00:01:17.833
He took a deep breath.

20
00:01:17.834 --> 00:01:22.941
He swam toward the hammerhead.

21
00:01:22.942 --> 00:01:29.701
"Um," Mo said. "Excuse me?"

22
00:01:29.702 --> 00:01:37.840
The shark grinned. "Oh, look! A yummy snack!"

23
00:01:37.841 --> 00:01:42.879
"Please don't eat me!" Mo cried.

24
00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.258
"My friends are caught in a trap.

25
00:01:45.259 --> 00:01:49.542
Can you help me free them?"

26
00:01:49.543 --> 00:01:54.919
The shark didn't say anything.

27
00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:58.094
He opened his mouth.

28
00:01:58.095 --> 00:02:01.989
Then he swam toward Mo.

